"Create a simple, clean, and modern FAQ section for a developer conference website called 'DevConf 2026'. Use basic HTML structures and clean CSS with a dark background, white text,
 and simple hover effects. The design must be fully responsive and easy to understand for beginners."

html code:
<section class="faq-section">
    <div class="faq-container">
        <h2 class="faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p class="faq-subtitle">Got questions? We've got answers.</p>

        <div class="faq-list">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3 class="faq-question">Who can attend DevConf 2026?</h3>
                <p class="faq-answer">Anyone interested in technology! Students, professional developers, designers, and tech enthusiasts are all welcome.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3 class="faq-question">Will the sessions be recorded?</h3>
                <p class="faq-answer">Yes, all keynote speeches and technical sessions will be recorded and shared with ticket holders after the event.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3 class="faq-question">Is there a student discount available?</h3>
                <p class="faq-answer">Absolutely! Valid student ID holders can get a 50% discount on the general admission tickets.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


css code:
.faq-section {
    background-color: #111827;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    font-family: sans-serif;
}
.faq-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}
.faq-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: #38bdf8;
}
.faq-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    color: #9ca3af;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
}
.faq-item {
    background-color: #1f2937;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid #38bdf8;
    transition: background 0.3s;
}
.faq-item:hover {
    background-color: #374151; 
}
.faq-question {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    color: #ffffff;
}
.faq-answer {
    color: #d1d5db;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
}